# 2026-08-30 tactic-oracle audit. The .jsonl is the per-attempt record for all
# 104 tactic_mismatch samples x 11 ladder rungs -- ~300KB, and the whole point
# is that anyone can rerun the ladder and diff against it.
!results/tactic_selection.json
!results/tactic_oracle.json
!results/tactic_oracle.jsonl
!results/tactic_oracle_probe.json
!results/tactic_oracle_repair.json

# Deploy artifact: written next to the source at deploy time so git_state()
# can answer on a host with no .git. It is generated FROM the commit it records,
# so leaving it untracked is what keeps run_meta.json`s `dirty` flag truthful --
# otherwise every deploy dirties the tree by writing this file.
CODE_VERSION

# 2026-08-30 GPU tactic-recovery experiments. The traces and verdicts are the
# evidence for GPU_TACTIC_RECOVERY.md and are kept; the content-addressed
# verifier cache is a rebuildable local speed-up and is not.
!results/exp1_*.verified.jsonl
!results/exp2_stageb_k16.jsonl
!results/exp2_*.verified.jsonl
!results/exp3_repair.jsonl
!results/exp3_*.verified.jsonl
!results/exp_vacuity.json
!results/GPU_TACTIC_RECOVERY.json
!results/*.run_meta.json
results/exp_verify_cache.json
